            "printed_page": 26
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Don't be afraid! I am a rich man! But... not all rich people have to be bad. Do you know what killed my mother? Not the disease the doctors name... not the fate the Vedantists speak of... poison prepared in the camp of the cruel... that killed my mother.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
